WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.310
Build a paper plan you can explain.

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:07.070
In this illustrative euro-dollar example,
entry is 1.1000.

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:12.530
Fix size at 0.10 lots.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:18.110
Set the stop at 1.0980 and target

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:21.470
at 1.1040.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:25.970
Before costs, that's $20 of estimated loss
and

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:27.630
$40 of target profit.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:31.970
Move only the stop to 1.0990.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:33.670
Loss becomes $10.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:36.210
Size and target profits stay unchanged.

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:39.890
Check the numbers, explain the change and
keep

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:41.170
this as paper practice.

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:43.870
These estimates do not guarantee an
outcome.

